<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH PRAZSKA ENERGETIKA 1996 NET DOWN.</title>
<headline>CZECH PRAZSKA ENERGETIKA 1996 NET DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results for year</p>
<p>ending December 31, 1996: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> Net profit	     362.32	vs	 454.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 567.63	vs	 728.22</p>
<p> Production	   7,296.40	vs     6,927.68</p>
<p> Total assets	 9,439.07	vs     8,219.78</p>
<p> Basic capital	3,869.44	vs     3,869.44</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Prazska Energetika a.s.. The</p>
<p>company is a regional electricity distributor based in Prague.</p>
<p>Results were calculated under Czech accounting standards.</p>
<p>Prazska Energetika shares are listed on the main market of the</p>
<p>Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
